{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mineshaft_t1","model_identifier":"mineshaft_t1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# mineshaft_t1\n\n- Cubes: finished 358, construction_0 59, construction_33 196, construction_66 208, ruined 236 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a tall iron-strapped timber A-frame headframe over a stone shaft collar, with a rope-wrapped spoked sheave wheel, a planked deck with a rope rail and a roofed winch drum. An ore cart on rails, a spoil heap with copper and iron ore lumps, an ore table, shoring timbers, tools, lanterns and a player-colour banner.\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `mineshaft_t1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Clips\n\n- `working` (3.0 s, loop): the sheave wheel turns once, the winch drum turns twice and the bucket rides down 18 u and back.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -36)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-34, 0, -38)\n- `fx_lantern_1` at (-10, 17.2, -46.4)\n- `fx_lantern_2` at (10, 17.2, -46.4)\n- `fx_lantern_3` at (0, 89.9, 4.2)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"earth_yard#5c4630_0","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-18.225,-0.3,-44],"to":[18.225,1.3,44],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0